        "output": "$ traceroute 8.8.8.8\ntraceroute to 8.8.8.8 (8.8.8.8), 3 hops max\n 1  _gateway (192.168.1.1)  0.72 ms\n 2  10.50.0.1 (10.50.0.1)  3.89 ms\n 3  dns.google (8.8.8.8)  11.20 ms\n\n$ ufw default deny incoming\nDefault incoming policy changed to 'deny'\n$ ufw allow 22/tcp\nRule added\n$ ufw allow 443/tcp\nRule added\n$ ufw enable\nFirewall is active and enabled on system startup\n$ ufw status\nStatus: active\nTo                         Action      From\n--                         ------      ----\n22/tcp                     ALLOW       Anywhere\n443/tcp                    ALLOW       Anywhere",
